-    <section className="border-y border-border bg-surface"><div className="mx-auto max-w-[1440px] px-5 py-24 md:px-8"><SectionTitle eyebrow="Readable by design" title="The atom and the recipe" intro="A plugin does one thing. A Blend names the things that become one working instance."/><div className="mt-12 grid gap-5 lg:grid-cols-2"><CodeBlock label="plugin.ts" code={pluginCode}/><CodeBlock label="blend.yml" code={yamlCode}/></div><p className="mt-6 text-sm text-muted-foreground">Plugins like the one above are published on <a href="https://cordisplugins.github.io" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" className="font-semibold text-foreground underline underline-offset-4">cordisplugins.github.io</a>, the sibling registry this site's own Blends pull from.</p></div></section>
